oes not want to face its contents.\n\nFumika witnesses the tragedies of people, both dead and alive, and sees their deepest secrets revealed. What is unclear, however, are the details of Fumika's past. Who was she before she came to be a carrier of shigofumi?\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Dissociative Identities","rank":91,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Suicide","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Denpa","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tomboy","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Work","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":75,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Afterlife","rank":74,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":72,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Episodic","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Disability","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Rehabilitation","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Revenge","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Magic","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tennis","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crime","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":55,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Guns","rank":54,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Police","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Office Lady","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":53,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Detective","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Writing","rank":46,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Shigofumi","english":"Shigofumi","native":"シゴフミ","romaji":"Shigofumi","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"死后文"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"英文名|Shigofumi: Letters from the Departed"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"奇迹邮递员"},{"language":null,"s